  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Omprakash Gupta vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 12 December, 2024 Author: Vivek Kumar Birla Bench: Vivek Kumar Birla High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:194649-Db Court No. - 29 Case :- Writ - C No. - 41352 of 2024 Petitioner :- Omprakash Gupta Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Avanish Kumar Pandey Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Vivek Kumar Birla,J. Hon'ble Ms. Nand Prabha Shukla,J. 1. 2. Present petition has been filed with following prayer:- Omprakash Gupta vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 12 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/171360309/ 1 \"a. Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of certiorari to quash the effect and operation of the impugned order dated 01.08.2024 passed by the Additional District Magistrate (Administration)/Judicial Officer, Bulandshahar (respondent no.2) as well as R.C.Paper No.36 dated 02.12.2024 issued by the respondent no.4 (enclosed as Annexure No.1 to the writ petition). b.",
    "facts": "Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of mandamus directing the respondents not to take any coercive action against the petitioner and also prevent to take penalty of Rs.40,000/- from the petitioner.",
    "arguments": "It is further submitted that the recovery citation is only a consequential order. 4. Learned counsel for the petitioner could not dispute the same. He, however, submits that some delay may have occurred in filing the appeal."
  },
